config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_CHROMECAST
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Chromecast"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYCHROMECAST
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_REQUESTS
	default n
	help
		discovery and control of Chromecast and Google Cast devices: media, playback state and volume (it uses pychromecast, which brings protobuf and zeroconf).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/ChromecastPlugin, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> Chromecast, enter the address of the device or let the plugin discover it.

		Upstream ships no license file: the README is installed with the plugin. The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
